<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25484" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπειράομαι</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-επειράθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					5.34
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πεπείραμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.91
				</span></i>
			:—<i>make trial</i> or <i>proof of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν Περσέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.109
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
			</span></i> Jun.<i><span class="en">
				7.2
			</span></i>; <i>try to impose on</i> a man, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				921b
			</span></i>: c. gen. rei, <i>have experience</i> of a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.91
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ αἴνιγμα συντιθέντι διαπειρωμένῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					27a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <u>Lg.</u>l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>attempt obstinately,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ψευδῆ λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
				</span></i>
			 l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> late in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπειρῶν δωροδοκίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
